      "question": "Why is my Bitaxe Gamma making less hashrate than the listing says?",
      "ok": true,
      "answer": "A Gamma at stock settings (525 MHz) is expected to run about 1.07 TH/s, while many listings quote 1.2 TH/s or more, which assumes a higher frequency. Check the 10-minute or 1-hour average rather than the live number. If it's still low, check your power supply (the Gamma runs on 5 V), clean the fan and heatsink, and make sure settings are at stock with the latest AxeOS.",
